{"version":1,"key":"card:272","content":{"id":272,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在实际的工作中，需要将其他对象的属性复制到另一个对象中，这个操作常称之为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mixin","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function mixin(receiver, supplier) {\n  Object.keys(supplier).forEach(function (key) {\n    receiver[key] = supplier[key];\n  });\n  return receiver;\n}","language":"js","uuid":"a23baa8e-b373-4828-bceb-987606606d0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在其他的库有相似的方法实现相同的功能，如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mix","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"extend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等等。ES6 引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，实现的功能与上述的相同，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不能复制原型链上的属性以及不可枚举的属性。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的语法如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Object.assign(target, ...sources);","language":"js","uuid":"1eaa8cb4-a1cd-464b-a53d-b187c457ab9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，以及任意多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"source","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"source","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的属性复制到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 当中，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的属性与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sources","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中某对象的属性相同，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的属性的值将会被覆盖，如果多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"source","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有相同的属性名，那么后面的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"source","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性值会覆盖签名的属性值。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let target = {};\nlet source1 = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  age: 2,\n};\nlet source2 = {\n  name: \"Bob\",\n};\n\nObject.assign(target, source1, source2);\nprint(target); // { name: 'Bob', age: 2 }","language":"js","uuid":"4192309a-ffa8-4c96-851a-87e89d0cd48c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行的是浅拷贝，如果需要进行深拷贝，需要另求他法。在使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行复制的过程中，会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"getter","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"setter","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.assign","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的更多细节，参考 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object/assign","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MDN Object.assign()"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1692110260181,"updateTime":1743303640422,"linkedCards":[{"id":273,"target":{"key":"card:273","type":"card","id":273},"summary":"在 ES5 中没有规定当遍历一个对象时应该以何种顺序来访问对象的属性，但是在 ES6 中规定了访问的顺序，这个影响了 Object.getOwnPropertyNames() 和 Reflect.ownKeys() ，同样也影响了调用 Ob...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640422}}